hu/lovecraft-mythos/great-old-ones/cthulhu\" class=\"entity-link\">Cthulhu</a>.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Created By:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/call-of-cthulhu/sandy-petersen\" class=\"entity-link\">Sandy Petersen</a>\n            — Petersen designed Call of <a href=\"/call-of-cthulhu/lovecraft-mythos/great-old-ones/cthulhu\" class=\"entity-link\">Cthulhu</a>.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Contains:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/call-of-cthulhu/investigator\" class=\"entity-link\">Investigator</a>\n            — Players take the role of investigators.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Contains:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/call-of-cthulhu/keeper\" class=\"entity-link\">Keeper</a>\n            — The <a href=\"/call-of-cthulhu/keeper\" class=\"entity-link\">Keeper</a> runs Call of <a href=\"/call-of-cthulhu/lovecraft-mythos/great-old-ones/cthulhu\" class=\"entity-link\">Cthulhu</a> games.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Adapted From:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/call-of-cthulhu/lovecraft-mythos\" class=\"entity-link\">Cthulhu Mythos</a>\n            — The RPG adapts Lovecraft&#039;s Mythos.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Contains:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/call-of-cthulhu/call-of-cthulhu-seventh-edition\" class=\"entity-link\">Call of Cthulhu 7th Edition</a>\n            — 7th Edition is the current core rules.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Contains:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/call-of-cthulhu/sanity\" class=\"entity-link\">Sanity</a>\n            — <a href=\"/call-of-cthulhu/sanity\" class=\"entity-link\">Sanity</a> rules define CoC horror.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Contains:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/call-of-cthulhu/basic-roleplaying\" class=\"entity-link\">Basic Role-Playing</a>\n            — CoC uses <a href=\"/call-of-cthulhu/basic-roleplaying\" class=\"entity-link\">Basic Role-Playing</